{%- comment -%}
  DR. EVIL'S COFFEE — ROAST + GRIND OPTIONS (product page)
  =======================================================
  Adds "Roast Level" and "Grind" selectors to the Shopify product page as
  LINE-ITEM PROPERTIES (no variant explosion, price stays the same). Customers who
  buy directly on shop.drevil.coffee get the same choices as the marketing site,
  and both land on the order for the Order Printer work order.

  INSTALL (Impact / Prestige / most Dawn-family themes)
   1. Online Store → Themes → ⋯ → Edit code.
   2. Snippets → Add a new snippet → name it `roast-grind-options` → paste this.
   3. In the product form section (e.g. sections/main-product.liquid or
      snippets/buy-buttons.liquid), render it INSIDE the <form> that has the
      Add-to-cart button, before the submit button:
        {% render 'roast-grind-options' %}
   4. Optional: gate it to coffee only, e.g. wrap with
        {% if product.type == 'Coffee' %} … {% endif %}

  The selected values post as properties[Roast Level] and properties[Grind].
{%- endcomment -%}

<div class="drevil-rg" style="margin:16px 0;font-family:inherit;">
  <div style="margin-bottom:14px;">
    <label for="drevil-roast" style="display:block;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.15em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:6px;">
      Roast Level
    </label>
    <select id="drevil-roast" name="properties[Roast Level]" style="width:100%;padding:10px;">
      <option value="Light Roast">Light Roast</option>
      <option value="House Roast" selected>House Roast — roaster's pick</option>
      <option value="Dark Roast">Dark Roast</option>
    </select>
  </div>

  <div>
    <label for="drevil-grind" style="display:block;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.15em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:6px;">
      Grind — ground to order
    </label>
    <select id="drevil-grind" name="properties[Grind]" style="width:100%;padding:10px;">
      <option value="Whole Bean" selected>Whole Bean — grind fresh, keeps longest</option>
      <option value="Espresso">Espresso</option>
      <option value="Moka Pot">Moka Pot</option>
      <option value="Aeropress">Aeropress</option>
      <option value="Pour Over (V60)">Pour Over (V60)</option>
      <option value="Drip / Auto">Drip / Auto</option>
      <option value="Chemex">Chemex</option>
      <option value="French Press">French Press</option>
      <option value="Cold Brew">Cold Brew</option>
    </select>
    <p style="font-size:12px;opacity:.7;margin-top:6px;">
      Whole bean recommended for the truest cup — grind just before brewing.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
